Yes. That is a much stronger comparison than the loose “sacred sound” category.

The common structure is not merely:

\[
\text{psychoactive drink}+\text{music}.
\]

It is closer to:

\[
\boxed{
\text{material transformation}
+
\text{sonic protocol}
+
\text{timed ritual sequence}
+
\text{ingestion}
\rightarrow
\text{altered/ritual state}
}
\]

and that is exactly the kind of **multi-channel key schedule** we have been converging toward.

